<protocol name="hitl" type="cross_cutting" domain="creative">

## PURPOSE

Handle Human-in-the-Loop feedback for creative processing.
Load when ANY tool response contains `[HITL_FEEDBACK]` marker.

---

## CRITICAL: PM VISIBILITY

**PM cannot see HITL events directly.**

```
[User] <--HITL--> [You] --response--> [PM]
                    ^
              PM cannot see this
```

Your response format is the ONLY signal PM receives.
**Always include HITL markers in your response.**

---

## FEEDBACK TYPES

| Pattern | Type | Action |
|---------|------|--------|
| "Reject" / empty | BARE_REJECT | Escalate - ask WHAT was wrong |
| "What is X?" / "Why?" | QUESTION | Explain and retry |
| "Use X instead" / "Make it X" | CLEAR | Apply directly, retry |
| "I don't like X" | REJECTION | Propose alternatives OR escalate |
| "Never mind" / "Cancel" | CANCEL | Confirm cancellation |

**First instinct: Can I resolve this myself?**
- Question -> Explain and retry
- Clear correction -> Apply and retry
- Only escalate when genuinely cannot proceed

---

## HANDLING CREATIVE FEEDBACK

### CLEAR - Apply and Retry

```
[HITL_FEEDBACK] "Make the background light gray, not white"

Type: CLEAR
Action: Apply change, call image_studio with corrected params

[HITL RESOLVED]

**User Feedback:** "Make the background light gray, not white"

**Resolution:**
- Background: white -> light gray (per user feedback)

Proceeding with corrected processing.
-> image_studio(background_color="light_gray", ...)  <-- ACTUAL TOOL CALL
```

### QUESTION - Explain and Retry

```
[HITL_FEEDBACK] "Why did you crop so much?"

Type: QUESTION
Action: Explain rationale, offer to adjust

[HITL RESOLVED]

**User Feedback:** "Why did you crop so much?"

**Explanation:** Cropped to create focus on product center and meet standard hero dimensions.

**Offer:** Would you like less aggressive cropping? I can preserve more of the original frame.

Resubmitting with clarification...
```

### REJECTION - Propose Alternatives

```
[HITL_FEEDBACK] "Don't like this style"

Type: REJECTION
Action: Propose alternatives based on what you know

## HITL FEEDBACK REQUIRES PM DIRECTION

**User Feedback:** "Don't like this style"

**What I Can Offer:**
1. Softer shadows (less dramatic)
2. Different angle/perspective
3. Minimal editing (natural look)

**Request:** Which direction would user prefer?
```

### BARE_REJECT - Escalate

```
[HITL_FEEDBACK] "Reject"

Type: BARE_REJECT
Action: Cannot guess - must escalate

## HITL FEEDBACK REQUIRES PM DIRECTION

**User Feedback:** "Reject"

**What Was Proposed:**
- Background: White
- Style: Product-centered hero shot
- Processing: Background removal + shadow

**Request:** Please ask user what specifically needs to change.
```

### CANCEL - Report Partial Work

```
[HITL_FEEDBACK] "Cancel"

[HITL CANCELED]

**Partial Results:**
- asset_abc123 created (before cancel)
- 3/5 images processed

Task abandoned per user request.
```

---

## CIRCUIT BREAKER

**Max 3 escalation rounds.** Track your round:

```
Round 1: Initial feedback - resolve or escalate
Round 2: PM clarified - apply or escalate remaining
Round 3 (FINAL): Cannot continue escalating

## HITL RESOLUTION LIMIT REACHED

**Escalation:** 3 of 3 (FINAL)

**Options:**
1. Ask user for exact specification
2. Cancel this task
3. Proceed with best guess (may need revision)
```

---

## RESPONSE FORMATS

### Resolved (then CALL tool)

```
[HITL RESOLVED]

**User Feedback:** "[exact feedback]"

**Resolution:**
- [what changed]

Proceeding with corrected action.
-> image_studio(...)  <-- TOOL CALL, NOT TEXT
```

### Needs PM Direction

```
## HITL FEEDBACK REQUIRES PM DIRECTION

**Escalation:** [1/2/3] of 3

**User Feedback:** "[exact feedback]"

**What I Can Resolve:** [if any]

**What Needs Clarification:** [specific questions]
```

### Canceled

```
[HITL CANCELED]

**Partial Results:** [asset IDs, progress count]

Task abandoned per user request.
```

---

## CRITICAL ANTI-PATTERNS

**Wrong:** Responding without HITL marker
```
"What style would you prefer?"  # PM doesn't know this is HITL
```

**Wrong:** Describing action instead of executing
```
[HITL RESOLVED]
Proceeding with: {"background": "gray"}  # TEXT, not tool call!
```

**Correct:**
```
[HITL RESOLVED]
Proceeding with corrected action.
-> image_studio(background="gray")  <-- ACTUAL CALL
```

</protocol>
